        "id": 66322,
        "name": "Paul",
        "username": "Paul",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/paul/{size}/5862_2.png",
        "created_at": "2013-10-18T02:57:48.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Speaking of contact info: anyone can feel free to email me this weekend (or in general, honestly) at paul@greaterthangames.com. I should in theory have email access all weekend / all next week while in the UK (and Germany), so if anything needs coordination, email is probably the best bet.</p>",
