      {
        "id": 66323,
        "name": "Matchstickman",
        "username": "Matchstickman",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/matchstickman/{size}/1880_2.png",
        "created_at": "2013-10-18T21:16:00.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Barring horrible travel complications I should be at the Harp tomorrow shortly after 6.</p>\n<p>As there's both a ground floor and a first floor* in the Harp&nbsp; &nbsp;  and no one really knows where we'll be or what anybody looks like, look for the crowd with the guy dressed in <font color=\"red\"><span class=\"bbcode-b\">Red</span></font>, that'll be me. (I wont be in Red on Sunday as we'll be in Leisure Games and I think it'll be pretty obvious who is playing Sentinels and who is not! But in a pub, everyone's have a swift pint and conversing eagerly with friends)</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>*<font size=\"10\">  not the same thing confused Americans, you're in England/Europe now!</font></p>",
